(18, 19, 'OPTOMA TRUE 4K PROJECTOR', '/uploads/1779703281733_True4K.jpg', '•	Display technology DLP™ Aspect ratio – compatible: 16:9, 16:10, Connections Inputs: Inputs 2 x HDMI 2.0, 1 x VGA (YPbPr/RGB), 1 x Audio 3.5mmOutputs 1 x Audio 3.5mm, 1 x USB-A power 1.5AControl 1 x RS232, 1 x 12V trigger', 198000.00, 'active', '2026-05-25 10:01:21'),
