(48, 21, 'ELIPSON PRESTIGE FACET 14C CENTER SPEAKER', '/uploads/1781612566342_ELIPSONPRESTIGEFACET14LCRSPEAKERa.vif', 'Type: Center speaker – 2-way – Laminar bass-reflex\r\nPower Handling: 150 W RMS\r\nRecommended Amplification: 40 – 200 W\r\n\r\nDrivers:\r\n\r\nTweeter: 25 mm (soft dome)\r\nMidbass: 2 x 170 mm (with central phase plug)\r\nFrequency Response (±3 dB): 43 Hz – 25 kHz\r\nSensitivity: 93 dB (1W/1m)\r\nCrossover: 3000 Hz – 18 dB/octave\r\n\r\nImpedance:\r\n\r\nNominal: 6 Ω\r\nMinimum: 4.5 Ω @ 180 Hz\r\nBass-Reflex Tuning Frequency: 57 Hz\r\nConnectors: Silver-plated binding posts (bi-wiring / bi-amping compatible)', 78000.00, 'active', '2026-05-26 05:26:20'),
(49, 21, 'ELIPSON INFINITE 8 LCR SPEAKER', '/uploads/1781612566344_ELIPSONINFINITE8LCRSPEAKERa.vif', 'Design\r\nBuilt-in cinema speaker\r\nLoad closed\r\n2 way\r\nSatin aluminum front panel\r\nSpeakon connectors and terminal blocks\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nSpeakers\r\n1x 17cm Rohacell / carbon speaker\r\n1x 29mm ring tweeter\r\n\r\n\r\nMeasures\r\nPower handling: 100 W (200 W peak)\r\nFrequency response: 75Hz to 30kHz\r\nSensitivity: 88dB/W/m\r\nImpedance: 8 ohms (4 ohms min)', 149000.00, 'active', '2026-05-26 05:33:34'),
(50, 16, 'INTEGRA 11.2 CHANNEL AV RECEIVER', '/uploads/1779773858945_Integera112.jpg', '•	Dolby Atmos Height Virtualization, Dolby Surround® and DTS® Neural: X up mixing, 8K video is supported on all six HDMI inputs and two of the three outputs. Massive custom transformer and customized 15,000 μF capacitors. DIRAC LIVE Room Correction, IMAX Enhanced A/V receiver', 269800.00, 'active', '2026-05-26 05:37:38'),
(51, 19, 'OPTOMA 4K UHD DUAL LASER DOLBY VISION PROJECTOR', '/uploads/1779774834154_OPTOMA4KUHDDUALLASERDOLBYVISIONPROJECTOR.jpg', '•	4K UHD Dual Laser DCI-P3 for Crystal Clear and Vibrant Visuals, Powered by Dolby Vision® and HDR10+Elevate your cinema experience, Pure Engine™ Ultra Next-Gen Visual Enhancement and Colour Customisation, Flexible Setup1.6x Zoom, Lens shift, 360 Projection, Enjoy Devise Casting and Mirroring', 485000.00, 'active', '2026-05-26 05:53:54'),
