(9769, 3766, 3801, 40, 'Samarth Kale', 'Positive Lead', 'Namaskar Tushar Sir 🙏🏼 \n\nSamartha kale this side from AV CORE (audio-video solutions) based in Baner, Pune! \n\n\n1. ALR Screen lagnar restaurants sathi (fixed or motorised)\n\n2. Short throw projector (expensive rahtat)\n\n3. ⁠Long throw projector (budget friendly rahtat)\n\nNote: \n\nScreens: Motorised screens need service in future as it is automated for folding operations. \n\nFixed screens are convenient for permanent installations. \n\nProjector’s: ⁠\nLed projector is old technology!\n\n4K projector’s are the best new age projector’s for future assurance!\n\nLong throw projectors are budget friendly \n\nShort throw projectors are little expensive . \n\nYour requirements : 75 inches screen \n\nMy suggestion: \n\nVisit our experience center in Baner, near Jupiter Hospital, Pune for best assurance about quality and guarantee. \n\n1. Take a 100inches portable screen which will cost around 50,000 rupees (INR) adding with a long throw projector, which both cost around 1lakhs 60,000 tentative. \n2. Short throw Projector which costs around 3 lakhs (as your screening space and projector’s placement is in open and ambient space)\n3. Long throw projector’s are budget friendly starting from 1 lakhs, but as your screening space and projector’s placement is open and ambient space, short throw projector’s will best suit your application\n\nSir let me know your choice, will share quotations according to your preferences. \n\nThank you', '2026-01-30 00:00:00', '2026-02-17 09:32:36'),
