(24652, 2441, 2476, 44, 'Nitin Mestry', 'Quotation Pending', 'thaya client cha acoustic karych ahe  and 5*1*2 cha setup pan ahe \nacoustic sathi 1000 sq ahe as client bola pan me dumaction takle ahe  yakda maam she dicuss kara and quatation send kara buject kami ahe client cha ', '2026-06-01 00:00:00', '2026-06-01 06:38:50'),
